          "description": "# Description\n\nAs a client of the asset registry service (including Retool UI), I should be able to fetch the list of all available tag definitions so that I can present users with valid tag options dynamically without hardcoding tags.\n\n# **Acceptance Criteria**\n\n* Proto definition for `ListTags` RPC exists in `assetsupport.proto`\n* `ListTagsRequest` message exists (empty message)\n* `ListTagsResponse` message returns list of `TagDefinition`\n* `TagDefinition` message includes:\n  * `~~tag~~`~~ (string) - Tag identifier (e.g., \"REBASING\")~~\n  * `description` (string) - Human-readable description\n  * `~~owner~~`~~ (string) - Team responsible (e.g., \"Protocols\")~~\n* gRPC handler exists in `internal/grpcserver/assetsupport_server.go`\n* Handler reads tag definitions from `internal/tags/tags.go`\n* Handler returns all tags defined in `tags.AllTags` map\n* Response is sorted alphabetically by tag name\n* Unit tests exist for handler\n* Integration test exists verifying correct tags are returned (nice to have)\n* gRPC server test exists covering the RPC\n* Handler can be tested manually with grpcurl\n* Proto code generation completes successfully\n\n# **Dependencies**\n\nNone",
