          "description": "# Description\n\nAs a client of the asset registry service, I should be able to call gRPC methods to query tags for assets and query assets by tags so that I can retrieve tag information via the service API.\n\n# **Acceptance Criteria**\n\n* `GetTagsByAssetTypeIDs` RPC definition exists in `assetsupport.proto`\n* `GetTagsByAssetTypeIDsRequest` message accepts repeated `asset_type_ids`\n* `GetTagsByAssetTypeIDsResponse` message returns map of asset_id to tags\n* `GetAssetIDsByTags` RPC definition exists\n* `GetAssetsIDsByTagsRequest` message accepts repeated tags\n* `GetAssetsIDsByTagsResponse` message returns list of matching asset IDs\n* Proto code generation completes successfully\n* All services compile after proto update\n* No breaking changes to existing RPCs\n\n# **Dependencies**\n\nNone",
