          "description": "# Description\n\nHave the ability to define and validate asset tags programmatically so that only approved tags can be applied to assets.\n\n# **Acceptance Criteria**\n\n* The `internal/tags/tags.go` file exists with `Tag` type and constants\n* `TagRebasing` and `TagStable` constants are defined\n* `Validate(tag string) error` function validates individual tags\n* `ValidateAll(tags []string) error` function validates multiple tags\n* `List() []Tag` function returns all valid tags\n* `GetMetadata(tag Tag) (TagMetadata, bool)` function returns tag metadata\n* Unit tests exist with \u003e90% coverage\n* Invalid tags return clear error messages\n\n# **Dependencies**\n\nNone",
